Z||000000||Wade87GT||04-17-2001||10:58 AM||||Does anybody know what the stock ride heights are for our cars and where are the measurements taken (very important, of course)? I have a lowered '87 GT and I need a baseline measurement for suspension tuning. About every car in my club has a different ride height. So I can't use any of those as a reference point. Some of the ones that still have the original suspension parts are as low as mine (sagging springs?).<BR> <A HREF="http://home.sprintmail.com/~wadeolsen/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://home.sprintmail.com/~wadeolsen/index.html</A> <P>Wade||||reg||5
